    70 : *    g. open-loop output impedance vs. frequency (zo)
    71 : *    h. output current through the supply (iout)
    72 : *    i. input voltage noise density vs. frequency (en)
    73 : *    j. input current noise density vs. frequency (in)
    74 : *    k. output voltage swing vs. output current (vo)
    75 : *    l. short-circuit output current (isc)
    76 : *    m. quiescent current (iq)
    77 : *    n. settling time vs. capacitive load (ts)
    78 : *    o. slew rate (sr)
    79 : *    p. small signal overshoot vs. capacitive load
    80 : *    q. large signal response
    81 : *    r. overload recovery time (tor)
    82 : *    s. input bias current (ib)
    83 : *    t. input offset current (ios)
    84 : *    u. input offset voltage (vos)
    85 : *    v. input offset voltage vs. temperature (vos drift)
    86 : *    w. input common-mode voltage range (vcm)
    87 : *    x. input offset voltage vs. input common-mode voltage (vos vs. vcm)
    88 : *    y. input/output esd cells (esdin, esdout) 
    89 : * 2. there should be four separate instances of opa4388 to accurately
    90 : *    match the product of opa4388.
